{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果行政總裁約翰·特努斯於當地時間10月28日在社交媒體發佈了一段簡短的預熱視頻，畫面顯示蘋果標誌投射在夜間城市天際線背景下的深色牆壁上。雖然視頻沒有直接展示任何新產品，也沒有明確提及觸摸屏，但由於蘋果預計當天公佈搭載OLED觸摸屏的新款MacBook Pro，這段視頻被普遍視為新產品發佈前的預熱。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584188.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T14:01:08.509244+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T13:41:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T13:58:15.653870+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T13:58:15.653870+00:00","content_hash":"8433029e9898b34fe9c9ff9beb0c4660486882915b5440ebf70369f84890573c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}